%% title: SWIFT Message Lifecycle
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PENDING : send() — persisted before network call
    PENDING --> VALIDATED : validate() passes
    VALIDATED --> SENT : submitted to SWIFTNet gateway
    SENT --> ACKNOWLEDGED : ACK received (ack_received_at set)
    ACKNOWLEDGED --> COMPLETED : settlement booked
    SENT --> REJECTED : NAK / timeout from scheme
    VALIDATED --> FAILED : gateway unreachable
    PENDING --> FAILED : validation error
    COMPLETED --> [*]
    REJECTED --> [*]
    FAILED --> [*]
